<title>JAPAN: Expected terms of JR East 60 bln yen 12-year bonds.</title>
<headline>Expected terms of JR East 60 bln yen 12-year bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>East Japan Railway Co (JR East) is likely to have set terms of 60 billion yen worth of 12-year straight bonds as follows, bond underwriters said:</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Industrial Bank of Japan (IBJ)</p>
<p> TYPE  straight bond  ISSUE NO   4	  AMT   60 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 25.Feb.09</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 25.Feb.97  INT PAY 25 Feb/Aug</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 5.Feb.97</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI  AAA	LAST NIS</p>
</text>
